  effect: 'On pickup, you may select a wish from a list of possible wishes. Then
    this item is destroyed. The wishes include: Heal (Heal to max hp, and be invaunarable
    for 9 seconds), Money (Gain a flat 5000$), Items (spawn 10 random items), and
    Smite (deal 1000 damage multiplied by your damage on both guns).'
  buff: '-'
  debuff: '-'
  effectSum: On pickup, you may select a wish from a list of possible wishes. Then
    this item is destroyed.
  buffSum: '-'
  debuffSum: '-'
  flavor: "The year was 1948 and a little girl was in her room staring at the night
    sky when a shooting star flew by, the words that came after echoed throughout
    the universe \u201CI wish for gun like 2 to come out in 2021\u201D Sadly not
    all wishes come to fruition. This one does though!"
